## 5. Recommended Alo King webhook configuration

```text
Kapso webhook type:      Kapso event-based webhook
Endpoint:                https://<alo-king-domain>/api/webhooks/kapso
Authentication:          X-Webhook-Signature HMAC-SHA256
Legacy ?key= support:    Temporary migration only
Raw-body verification:   Required
Idempotency:             X-Idempotency-Key + database unique constraint
Response target:         HTTP 200 within 10 seconds
Processing model:        Persist/enqueue first, process asynchronously
Required events:         received, sent, delivered, read, failed
```

Do not equate **message sent** with **message delivered**:

```text
sent → delivered → read
              ↘ failed
```

Store Kapso’s message ID, event name, status history, provider error code, idempotency key, and timestamps for every outbound notification.
